@startuml
title Weather Station System States

[*] --> Restart : Shutdown condition

state "Restart" as Restart
state "Running" as Running
state "Configuration Mode" as ConfigurationMode
state "Data Collection" as DataCollection
state "Summary Preparation" as SummaryPreparation
state "Status Checking" as StatusChecking
state "Controlled Mode" as ControlledMode
state "Shutdown" as Shutdown

Restart --> Running : Begin running from a shut down condition
Running --> ConfigurationMode : Changes or power-saving settings required
ConfigurationMode --> Running : Configuration completed
Running --> DataCollection : Triggered by the clock
DataCollection --> Running : After data collection
SummaryPreparation --> Running : After summary preparation
StatusChecking --> Running : After status checking
Running --> ControlledMode : Through remote control
ControlledMode --> Shutdown : Shutdown command given while running
Shutdown --> [*] : Final state

@enduml
